WEBVTT

00:03:58.326 --> 00:04:02.974
striving to utilize scientific knowledge
to cure human diseases.

00:04:03.685 --> 00:04:08.523
Things like cancer, aging,
degenerative diseases;

00:04:08.547 --> 00:04:12.879
these are but some
of the undesirables we wish to tame.

00:04:13.817 --> 00:04:15.261
I often wonder:

00:04:15.285 --> 00:04:18.446
Why is it that we are having
so much trouble

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:20.632
trying to solve the problem of cancer?

00:04:21.096 --> 00:04:24.350
Is it that we're trying to solve
the problem of cancer,

00:04:24.374 --> 00:04:26.668
and not trying to understand life?

00:04:27.657 --> 00:04:30.845
Life on this planet
shares a common origin,